+## Self-hosting
+
+Deploy your fork to a single Linux server with Docker, SQLite and automatic HTTPS:
+
+1. Fill in your hostname, mail server and image in [`config/deploy.yml`](config/deploy.yml)
+2. Copy [`.kamal/secrets.example`](.kamal/secrets.example) to `.kamal/secrets` and fill in `SECRET_KEY_BASE`, `KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD` and `SMTP_PASSWORD`
